    UpdateAfterConventional: Add conventional choice to history
    UpdateAfterConventional: Update habit strength

    UpdateAfterTarget --> WaitForNextOpportunity
    UpdateAfterConventional --> WaitForNextOpportunity

    WaitForNextOpportunity: Advance simulation time
    WaitForNextOpportunity --> EndCheck

    state EndCheck <<choice>>

